      "description": "Code lists this layer owns, one `folio-code-list/v1` file per list, inherited by every dependent through the dependency overlay (`codeListDirs`) and exported as SKOS with the harness's. A `recommendation` block's `strength` names a code here, so the check is \"resolves in the scheme\" rather than a closed enum. Two lists: `grade-recommendation-strength` (GRADE as WHO applies it) and `rfc2119-requirement-level` (BCP 14). A folio whose issuing body grades differently declares its own list rather than editing these.",
